abstract: >
  Supplementary data and reproducibility code for the manuscript
  "Model Rankings Are Not Self-Interpreting: A Claim-Calibrated Evaluation
  of Spatial AI in Health Care Forecasting" (submitted to Health Information Science and Systems, 2026).
  Includes the 51-environment Study 1 comparator audit dataset and a
  standard-library-only Python script that reproduces all reported
  arithmetic summaries and ICI-E1 Pearson correlations.
keywords:
  - spatial AI
  - claim-calibrated evaluation
  - health care forecasting
  - spatiotemporal graph neural networks
  - model benchmarking
  - null results
  - transparency
